# Branchwood (Chapter 2): the north gate of the Crossroads opens onto the south bank. The
# first fork splits west to the weighbridge over the gorge (2-01) and east to an overlook
# with a chest. Across the bridge a second fork: north to Sable's lodge (Spyglass, 2-02,
# the waystone), east into the darker glade of null-wisps. Past the glade the crow letter
# waits on a stump, and the road east to the Mire is coiled with loopers.
